**integrator.cpp advances aim turn rates with acceleration/deceleration limits.**

## Interface

`turn_integrator::advance(deg_per_s target, const limits& lim, seconds dt) noexcept` returns `degrees`; operates in `gamepad::unstable::controller::aim`.

## Behavior

`advance` returns `degrees{0.0f}` for `dt <= 0`; otherwise clamps `current_` toward `target` by `lim.accel * dt` or `lim.decel * dt`, with non-positive limits causing instantaneous convergence. `advance` integrates displacement via `0.5f * (prev + cur) * dt`.

## Dependencies

`std::min` and `std::max` enforce target bounds; `degrees`, `deg_per_s`, `limits`, `seconds`, and `current_` define the unit-typed state.